{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started with Swidux"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux"]]},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Add Swidux to your project and wire up unidirectional data flow with automatic persistence.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide walks through the four steps to integrate Swidux: add the package, define your types, wire the store, and connect views."}]},{"text":"Add the Package","anchor":"Add-the-Package","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" File > Add Package Dependencies, paste "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/Swidux"},{"type":"text","text":", set "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Up to Next Major","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1.0.0"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Package.swift:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["dependencies: [","    .package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/Swidux\", from: \"1.0.0\"),","]"]},{"anchor":"Define-Your-Types","level":2,"text":"Define Your Types","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Re-export Swidux from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppState.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" so no other file needs "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Swidux"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ App\/AppState.swift","import Foundation","@_exported import Swidux","","@Swidux","struct AppState: Equatable, Sendable {","    var items = EntityStore<Item>()","    var tags  = EntityStore<Tag>()","    @Slice var ui = UIState()","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Swidux"},{"type":"text","text":" generates an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Observable"},{"type":"text","text":" companion class and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxObservable"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Slice"},{"type":"text","text":" marks nested state slices that get their own observer class for per-property observation granularity."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Specialize the generic effect system with your action type:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ App\/Effect.swift","typealias Send = Swidux.Send<AppAction>","typealias Effect = Swidux.Effect<AppAction>"]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Send","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@MainActor @Sendable (Action) -> Void"},{"type":"text","text":" — dispatched actions hop back to the MainActor."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Effect","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Sendable"},{"text":" async closure. Run with ","type":"text"},{"code":"Task { @concurrent in }","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to stay off the MainActor.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Define your action tree and root reducer:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ App\/AppAction.swift","enum AppAction: Sendable {","    case items(ItemAction)","    case tags(TagAction)","}","","\/\/ App\/AppReducer.swift","struct AppReducer: SwiduxReducer {","    let itemReducer = ItemReducer()","    let tagReducer  = TagReducer()","","    func reduce(","        state: inout AppState,","        action: AppAction,","        environment: AppEnvironment","    ) -> Effect? {","        switch action {","        case .items(let action):","            return itemReducer.reduce(state: &state, action: action, environment: environment)","        case .tags(let action):","            return tagReducer.reduce(state: &state, action: action, environment: environment)","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Feature reducers conform to "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/SwiduxReducer","type":"reference"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Action = FeatureAction"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootAction = AppAction"},{"text":". Return ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" when no async work is needed:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["struct ItemReducer: SwiduxReducer {","    func reduce(state: inout AppState, action: ItemAction, environment: AppEnvironment) -> Effect? {","        switch action {","        case .increment(let id):","            state.items.modify(id) { $0.count += 1 }","        }","        return nil","    }","}"]},{"anchor":"Wire-the-Store","level":2,"text":"Wire the Store","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Store"},{"type":"text","text":" is a generic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Observable"},{"text":" class that owns the dispatch cycle, plugin lifecycle, and observation layer. Define a typealias and a factory method:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["typealias AppStore = Store<AppState, AppAction>","","extension Store where State == AppState, Action == AppAction {","    static func configured() -> AppStore {","        let reducer = AppReducer()","        let environment = AppEnvironment.live()","","        let persistencePlugin = PersistencePlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","            writers: [","                StateWriter(keyPath: \\.items) { writes, deletes in","                    for item in writes { try? await db.upsert(item) }","                    for id in deletes  { try? await db.delete(id: id) }","                },","            ]","        )","","        let plugins = PluginHost<AppState, AppAction>()","        plugins.register(persistencePlugin)","","        return Store(","            initialState: AppState(),","            reducer: { state, action in","                reducer.reduce(state: &state, action: action, environment: environment)","            },","            plugins: plugins,","            persistencePlugin: persistencePlugin","        )","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Store"},{"type":"text","text":" handles the snapshot pattern internally — packing the observer tree into a struct, running the reducer, then unpacking only changed properties back. Views access state through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@dynamicMemberLookup"},{"type":"text","text":", which forwards to the generated observer class tree."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Wire Views","anchor":"Wire-Views"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Views read from the store and dispatch actions. They don’t import Swidux or touch the database:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct ItemListView: View {","    @Environment(AppStore.self) private var store","","    var body: some View {","        List(store.items.values) { item in","            Text(item.name)","        }","        .toolbar {","            Button(\"Add\") { store.send(.items(.create)) }","        }","    }","}"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"App Entry Point","anchor":"App-Entry-Point"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Own the store with "},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and inject it via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".environment()"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var store = AppStore.configured()","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","                .environment(store)","        }","    }","}"]},{"text":"Next Steps","anchor":"Next-Steps","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStoreGuide"},{"text":" — Learn the full ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"},{"text":" API","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide","type":"reference"},{"text":" — Configure persistence writers","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/ArchitectureGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Understand the snapshot pattern and performance considerations","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxObservable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — Hand-write observation bridging for advanced cases","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Reference","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/MacrosReference","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginKillswitchReference","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginParentalGateReference","doc:\/\/Swid